      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got told i have hyperthyroidism like my thyroid is working too hard lol. but i take adderall for adhd and lately i've been feeling super jittery and my heart feels like it's racing a bit. is it okay to keep taking my regular dose or should i be worried about mixing them??",
