      "content": "i mean i know i should call them but they're booked out for weeks and i really need to focus for work tomorrow... its not like im having chest pains or anything, just a bit of a fast pulse. do you think i could just take a half dose instead of a full dose to see if that settles the jitters? it shouldn't be that big of a deal if i just lower it a little bit.",
